  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f83d6c0bdd70e3f6fff483e1c91770378481de7_0.webp\" alt=\"Вариант свиньи Mizuno\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Текстурпак для Mizuno Craft16</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8cef494b-fe2d-420f-b587-5a0c81d95ee0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"531\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7ecda9c4-3ff7-4534-b2c7-87acd9da4942.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"279\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Требуется:<br></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a><br>Fabric&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a></p>\n<p><strong>Естественное появление: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fPig%2523Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">вики</a></strong><strong> (версия 2.0+)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Все мои аддоны Mizuno.<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unofficial Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected T